lete them. This is less efficient,\nhowever the files in question are fairly small, so there's probably no\nneed to rename _when we can_ as an optimization.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D217727", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/config.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/std/fs.rs", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/app/src/test.rs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "61e4f4a7e4fb2e5c1fb2ee3dfb7f53b8d2a38d0c", "parents": ["b0dace9bcd6c9d103974a65b73f33a09786dcf56"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917715 - Don't use nsLayoutUtils::GetColor for SVG rects. r=dholbert a=RyanVM\n\nIt's intended for text colors only (and it applies auto-darkening in\nprinting), see nsLayoutUtils::DarkenColorIfNeeded.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221556", "files": ["layout/svg/SVGGeometryFrame.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6406a33feba2e6fe877fdd983eb133f66fcca389", "parents": ["61e4f4a7e4fb2e5c1fb2ee3dfb7f53b8d2a38d0c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917715 - Rename nsLayoutUtils::GetColor. r=longsonr,dholbert a=RyanVM\n\nIt's suitable for foreground colors only.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221557", "files": ["layout/base/nsLayoutUtils.h", "layout/generic/TextOverflow.cpp", "layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsTextFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsTextPaintStyle.cpp", "widget/Theme.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9677c428f76110b327f4ef2ea925bbe0c79cfea6", "parents": ["6406a33feba2e6fe877fdd983eb133f66fcca389"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917715 - Add a test for this bug. r=dholbert a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221558", "files": ["layout/reftests/svg/rect-no-backgrounds-print-ref.html", "layout/reftests/svg/rect-no-backgrounds-print.html", "layout/reftests/svg/reftest.list"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "91f6011b864e09202e588819b8a008c1027e6d8a", "parents": ["9677c428f76110b327f4ef2ea925bbe0c79cfea6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726080071, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "148": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yury Delendik \u003cydelendik@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1914963 - Combine wasmMarkSlowCall and call(reg). r=jseward, a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220051", "files": ["js/src/jit/MacroAssembler.cpp", "js/src/jit/MacroAssembler.h", "js/src/jit/arm/MacroAssembler-arm.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm64/MacroAssembler-arm64.cpp", "js/src/jit/loong64/MacroAssembler-loong64.cpp", "js/src/jit/mips64/MacroAssembler-mips64.cpp", "js/src/jit/riscv64/MacroAssembler-riscv64.cpp", "js/src/jit/x64/MacroAssembler-x64.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/MacroAssembler-x86-shared.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86/MacroAssembler-x86.cpp", "js/src/jsapi-tests/testWasmReturnCalls.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ba89946f61c47818e9b4de2de3543ea15e0ab42b", "parents": ["91f6011b864e09202e588819b8a008c1027e6d8a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726107625, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "149": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr128 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221949", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ac9d5ccdfb2284e40c4d6449ef9fae34af3921ca", "parents": ["ba89946f61c47818e9b4de2de3543ea15e0ab42b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726141950, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "150": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1914594 - Move docshell.newWindowTarget to be on LoadInfo  a=diannaS\n\nPreviously, this was passed around using the nsHashPropertyBag base\nclass on HTTP channels. In bug 1907269, this base was added to\nnsExtProtocolChannel to support reading this property for external\nprotocols.\n\nThis unfortunately ended up not working when a HTTP channel redirects to\nan external protocol, as the hash property propagation logic in\nnsHttpChannel happens after the check that the target channel is a HTTP\nchannel, so the property was lost when redirecting to an external\nprotocol.\n\nRather than refactoring HTTP redirect logic, this patch simplifies by\nmoving the property onto the LoadInfo where it will be trivially\npreserved across redirects, and available in the places which need it.\n\nBecause the nsHashPropertyBag base is no longer required for\nnsExtProtocolChannel, it is also removed.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221876", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.h", "dom/ipc/PContent.ipdl", "ipc/glue/BackgroundUtils.cpp", "netwerk/base/LoadInfo.cpp", "netwerk/base/LoadInfo.h", "netwerk/base/TRRLoadInfo.cpp", "netwerk/base/nsILoadInfo.idl", "netwerk/ipc/DocumentLoadListener.cpp", "netwerk/ipc/NeckoChannelParams.ipdlh", "uriloader/exthandler/ExternalHelperAppParent.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/ExternalHelperAppParent.h", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.h", "uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalProtocolHandler.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/tests/mochitest/browser_protocol_ask_dialog.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "200513d5d11c5d3dda89f3db9a6ffce2220c8fb0", "parents": ["ac9d5ccdfb2284e40c4d6449ef9fae34af3921ca"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726158292, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "151": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yannis Juglaret \u003cyjuglaret@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1915813 - Fix a crash with Microsoft TTD.  a=diannaS\n\nMicrosoft TTD has a CPU emulation bug that makes Firefox crash when ran\nunder TTD. This patch mitigates the issue.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220829\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221934", "files": ["gfx/qcms/src/transform_avx.rs", "gfx/qcms/src/transform_sse2.rs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0bfc7b8ebc92b159d05cbef051392328e118a0a9", "parents": ["200513d5d11c5d3dda89f3db9a6ffce2220c8fb0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726162275, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "152": {"changesets": [{"author": "Fatih \u003cfkilic@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1891690: Return GMT when RFPTarget::JSDateTimeUTC is enabled.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D216411\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221687", "files": ["browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser_exslt_timezone_load.js", "dom/xslt/xslt/txEXSLTFunctions.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ab97e704a3f9a0fdc2511ae39848e3ecb905e19b", "parents": ["0bfc7b8ebc92b159d05cbef051392328e118a0a9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fatih \u003cfkilic@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916109: Don't force new process and improve the test.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220774\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221686", "files": ["browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser_exslt_timezone_load.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "74844a821bcad17913bb9da8059da5e9fd27c453", "parents": ["ab97e704a3f9a0fdc2511ae39848e3ecb905e19b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fatih \u003cfkilic@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1912129: Reduce time precision for EXSLT date time function.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D218783\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220905", "files": ["browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser_exslt_time_precision.js", "dom/xslt/xslt/txEXSLTFunctions.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "47094b16c4015e322d85e65e54d36efe0c12e361", "parents": ["74844a821bcad17913bb9da8059da5e9fd27c453"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Fatih \u003cfkilic@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918104: Skip test on windows and move setTimeZone call. r=tjr a=test-only", "files": ["browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/resistfingerprinting/test/browser/browser_exslt_timezone_load.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3279c299ae0dd5cca4ab5123e0a59bd04294c609", "parents": ["47094b16c4015e322d85e65e54d36efe0c12e361"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726189798, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "153": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dave Townsend \u003cdtownsend@oxymoronical.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916411: Call InitializeMacApp before showing the profile locked dialog.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220869\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221676", "files": ["toolkit/xre/nsAppRunner.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fe8798e2bb8e9bb6f3edb56fe89aced7bc42d69d", "parents": ["3279c299ae0dd5cca4ab5123e0a59bd04294c609"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726195617, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "154": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Chevobbe \u003cnchevobbe@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916881 - [devtools] Don't use for..in loop to iterate over jQuery events.  a=RyanVM.\n\nfor..in will loop through the prototype chain, which might get us into trouble\nwhen the Array prototype is extended (e.g. with Moo.js).\nSince the jquery events object we get might already be an arrays in some cases,\nwe can iterate other them directly, and only creating arrays when those are objects.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221118\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221621", "files": ["devtools/client/inspector/markup/test/doc_markup_events_jquery.html", "devtools/server/actors/inspector/event-collector.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2b7e72a36a675833f5fba2a9a409bdc21a9dc28c", "parents": ["fe8798e2bb8e9bb6f3edb56fe89aced7bc42d69d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726195711, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "155": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1913543 - Apply a fix for https://bugs.kde.org/show_bug.cgi?id=492663.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221100\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221888", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/packages/debian.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "52b3a5386fdd9aee823e901c16d1bdfe332a791f", "parents": ["2b7e72a36a675833f5fba2a9a409bdc21a9dc28c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mike Hommey \u003cmh+mozilla@glandium.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1913543 - Apply the final upstream fix instead of our crude workaround.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221568\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221889", "files": ["build/debian-packages/valgrind.diff", "taskcluster/kinds/packages/debian.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "762cf081abc92b8c441fddd5ef05e1e0d35dfc68", "parents": ["52b3a5386fdd9aee823e901c16d1bdfe332a791f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726195769, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "156": {"changesets": [{"author": "Randell Jesup \u003crjesup@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1872744: Clean up DNSReqestSender::Cancel r=necko-reviewers,valentin, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220711", "files": ["netwerk/dns/DNSRequestChild.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8dc4bb1743024a932650d66e8a21f05b714b6b93", "parents": ["762cf081abc92b8c441fddd5ef05e1e0d35dfc68"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726196605, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "157": {"changesets": [{"author": "Greg Stoll \u003cgstoll@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917631 - clean up logic around content analysis pref  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221648\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221987", "files": ["toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.cpp", "toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.h", "toolkit/components/contentanalysis/nsIContentAnalysis.idl", "widget/nsClipboardProxy.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a2b46df5724dac486aa721afa9d9ff5662770f6b", "parents": ["8dc4bb1743024a932650d66e8a21f05b714b6b93"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726239606, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "158": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr128 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222273", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/translations-models.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "47c387a84cfee4459714afdf67f45037c19ba935", "parents": ["a2b46df5724dac486aa721afa9d9ff5662770f6b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726515375, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "159": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1675077 - Add policy for PrivateBrowsingModeAvailability.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D216315\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222289", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/Policies.sys.mjs", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/schemas/policies-schema.json", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_privatebrowsingmodeavailability.js", "browser/components/preferences/privacy.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/policies/policies-descriptions.ftl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fa3702574f86c56592cf580ffbb3696687ab761e", "parents": ["47c387a84cfee4459714afdf67f45037c19ba935"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726536806, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "160": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nick Alexander \u003cnalexander@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918473 - Add missing `await`s to install and uninstall background tasks.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222007\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222313", "files": ["browser/modules/BackgroundTask_install.sys.mjs", "browser/modules/BackgroundTask_uninstall.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "54bca34ad2bfab2b8383c03189fdf39793e49810", "parents": ["fa3702574f86c56592cf580ffbb3696687ab761e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726537763, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "161": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1915602 - set phabricator callsign to ESRONETWOEIGHT. a=release DONTBUILD", "files": [".arcconfig"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ccfed19e5408b1205448cb8a03b2b96dcafbd3ac", "parents": ["54bca34ad2bfab2b8383c03189fdf39793e49810"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726577455, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "162": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sam Johnson \u003csam@scj.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1912338 - Consistently hide macOS titlebar separator for full screen windows.  a=diannaS\n\nIn bug 1906034, I attempted to preserve the workaround for the white line issue from bug 1700211, but it did not prevent the white line from appearing. Hiding the separator in response to full-screen events avoids the issue.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221576\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222133", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsCocoaWindow.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a266d935ccdda4fae6dab3f6363b892bc284a808", "parents": ["ccfed19e5408b1205448cb8a03b2b96dcafbd3ac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sam Johnson \u003csam@scj.me\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1912338 - Fix titlebar separator hiding workaround on macOS 11.  a=diannaS\n\nOn macOS 11, MOZTitlebarAccessoryView's viewWillMoveToWindow: is called both when transitioning to full screen, and when transitioning out of full screen. In the case of transitioning into full screen, the window passed to viewWillMoveToWindow: has titlebarAppearsTransparent=false, meaning that the condition added to this function in bug 1906034 caused the title bar separator to always be enabled when in full screen on macOS 11. This patch fixes the logic to instead check if the passed NSWindow is our ToolbarWindow or something else.\n\nOn later macOS releases, MOZTitlebarAccessoryView's viewWillMoveToWindow: is called when transitioning out of from full screen, but not when transitioning to full screen. This is why disabling the title bar separator in windowDidEnterFullScreen: is also necessary.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221909\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222136", "files": ["widget/cocoa/nsCocoaWindow.h", "widget/cocoa/nsCocoaWindow.mm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e4d47fc4145e0b9640c6610f2a4406983658c81a", "parents": ["a266d935ccdda4fae6dab3f6363b892bc284a808"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726603414, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "163": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicholas Rishel \u003cnrishel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917674 - Part 1: Fix set to default throwing exception from ShellService in Firefox Background Tasks.  a=diannaS\n\nThis succeeds in normal Firefox due to `QueryInterface(Ci.nsIWindowsShellService)` having likely been called on the `nsIShellService` prior to this call, which populates the root `nsIShellService` JavaScript object with the queried interface methods. In Firefox Background Tasks the relevant `QueryInterface` is unlikely to be called ahead of time, resulting in an exception.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221540\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222325", "files": ["browser/components/shell/ShellService.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "da04566d06b79ac755faf79a65acfc296660f1a0", "parents": ["e4d47fc4145e0b9640c6610f2a4406983658c81a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726622983, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "164": {"changesets": [{"author": "Greg Stoll \u003cgstoll@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1915350: cache the final Content Analysis response for WARN results  a=diannaS\n\nInstead of caching the fact that the DLP Agent returned WARN, cache\nwhether the user chose to ALLOW or BLOCK. This is more helpful, and\napparently was causing hangs.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220464\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222619", "files": ["toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.cpp", "toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a7758daafcc857387eaf34928e6932fd269396d3", "parents": ["da04566d06b79ac755faf79a65acfc296660f1a0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726667091, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "165": {"changesets": [{"author": "Greg Stoll \u003cgstoll@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918028 - avoid potential future hang when cancelling Content Analysis WARN response  a=diannaS\n\nDon't cache canceled CA results, as this can cause particular problem with WARN responses,\nwhich shouldn't be in the cache.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221880\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222620", "files": ["toolkit/components/contentanalysis/ContentAnalysis.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1236883f5c9be5fd5029e93b7fc26c2425f31f63", "parents": ["a7758daafcc857387eaf34928e6932fd269396d3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726672005, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "166": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicholas Rishel \u003cnrishel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916780 - Enable 1-click Windows set-to-default for Firefox.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D221082\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222322", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "484dc4a03b4f4300e4806c6a15259511f35cd2ad", "parents": ["1236883f5c9be5fd5029e93b7fc26c2425f31f63"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726694365, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "167": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1886222 - Start reload by calling reload in the parent. r=Gijs,canadahonk,smaug, a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D211519", "files": ["browser/actors/BrowserTabChild.sys.mjs", "browser/base/content/browser-commands.js", "docshell/base/CanonicalBrowsingContext.cpp", "docshell/shistory/nsISHistory.idl"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4f5be7d4d9f3d7737d92551dc5478a3e5d064843", "parents": ["484dc4a03b4f4300e4806c6a15259511f35cd2ad"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726704189, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "168": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918386 - browser.search.get() should be returning data URIs for application provided search engines.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222264\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222466", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/parent/ext-search.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_search_favicon.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "59438e8b69e8f5b2bf0be9909e9d05c310272962", "parents": ["4f5be7d4d9f3d7737d92551dc5478a3e5d064843"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726705326, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "169": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changeset 59438e8b69e8 (bug 1918386) for causing perma failures on esr128, a=backout", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/parent/ext-search.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_search_favicon.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c29a5d66a558da7d9e576a043937f798525c4fc0", "parents": ["59438e8b69e8f5b2bf0be9909e9d05c310272962"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726711769, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "170": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1776017 - Disable browser_open_internal_choice_persistence.js on macosx for frequent failures. r=jmaher, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222731", "files": ["uriloader/exthandler/tests/mochitest/browser.toml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "68d07e5889415043d4ec86357edf7c3208000fa9", "parents": ["c29a5d66a558da7d9e576a043937f798525c4fc0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918386 - browser.search.get() should be returning data URIs for application provided search engines. a=dsmith\n\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222264\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222466", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/parent/ext-search.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_search_favicon.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a88b1dd6546fdc70299a6794f4a42e4b0a5618ed", "parents": ["68d07e5889415043d4ec86357edf7c3208000fa9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726759272, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "171": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrew Osmond \u003caosmond@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918778 - Correct ownership/recycling issues with MacIOSurface.  a=diannaS\n\nThis patch corrects a few different issues related to recycling\nMacIOSurface objects.\n\n1) When recycling a surface, we must check that the cached surfaces\n   match all of the requested parameters, not just the size. If we do\n   not, we should just flush the whole cache immediately since they\n   should all be created with the same parameters.\n\n2) Allocations can fail, and we should check for failing to get a\n   surface from the allocator and fall back if so.\n\n3) Locking can fail, and we should check that return value at all of the\n   call sites.\n\nThis may help resolve a number of otherwise difficult to understand\ncrash signatures. It may also solve display corruption issues in rare\ncases where the parameters that changed were roughly equivalent such\nthat everything appears to work, but they differ enough to change the\npresentation.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222775", "files": ["gfx/2d/MacIOSurface.cpp", "gfx/2d/MacIOSurface.h", "gfx/layers/MacIOSurfaceHelpers.cpp", "gfx/layers/MacIOSurfaceImage.cpp", "gfx/layers/MacIOSurfaceImage.h", "gfx/layers/NativeLayerCA.mm", "gfx/layers/opengl/MacIOSurfaceTextureClientOGL.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderMacIOSurfaceTextureHost.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8eb3b3604c35ad17faaf1220fe38dbe662c59f92", "parents": ["a88b1dd6546fdc70299a6794f4a42e4b0a5618ed"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726761124, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "172": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr128 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings tld-suffixes -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222839", "files": ["netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4c8bd0033a0c912e3c558b82c89337a6a447847d", "parents": ["8eb3b3604c35ad17faaf1220fe38dbe662c59f92"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726764690, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "173": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1881037 - Part 1: Stop showing unknown protocol error pages for web-triggered loads, r=smaug,necko-reviewers,kershaw, a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D217495", "files": ["docshell/base/nsDocShell.cpp", "docshell/base/nsDocShell.h", "netwerk/ipc/DocumentLoadListener.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9f3bfadcf8ff72cea9082a88484f3fc405879439", "parents": ["4c8bd0033a0c912e3c558b82c89337a6a447847d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1881037 - Part 2: Add a basic test for loading unknown protocols in a popup window, r=smaug, a=dsmith\n\nThe console notification is only created when an error page would not\notherwise load, so allows us to detect the situation where the error\npage is not going to be loaded.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D218984", "files": ["docshell/test/mochitest/mochitest.toml", "docshell/test/mochitest/test_popup_unknown_protocol.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4c3351b494499028937f12cff7202f59ed672f86", "parents": ["9f3bfadcf8ff72cea9082a88484f3fc405879439"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726793489, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "174": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mike Kaply \u003cmozilla@kaply.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1919318 - Don't set SOCKS proxy for UseHTTPProxyForAllProtocols.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222497\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222788", "files": ["browser/components/enterprisepolicies/helpers/ProxyPolicies.sys.mjs", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/xpcshell/test_proxy.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9b4092964685307e332a7d3dd731b76d8b864384", "parents": ["4c3351b494499028937f12cff7202f59ed672f86"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726795183, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "175": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917017 - Add a null-check in FirePageHideEventForFrameLoaderSwap. r=smaug, a=dsmith\n\nNot sure what guarantees this in presence of random script running?\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222335", "files": ["dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "143b15b706a95a9bbd150aea332772aa2dd0b96e", "parents": ["9b4092964685307e332a7d3dd731b76d8b864384"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726798512, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "176": {"changesets": [{"author": "Olli Pettay \u003cOlli.Pettay@helsinki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1905843, prevent unexpected use of result site origin,  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D215496\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222921", "files": ["caps/nsScriptSecurityManager.h", "dom/security/nsContentSecurityManager.cpp", "dom/security/nsContentSecurityManager.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "2057fd30ca70fd02e7cd4829ed48a3490caa075d", "parents": ["143b15b706a95a9bbd150aea332772aa2dd0b96e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726827505, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "177": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dana Keeler \u003cdkeeler@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1915008 - leak mResultTask if dispatch fails in certificate verification (esr128)  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222996", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/SSLServerCertVerification.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/SSLServerCertVerification.h", "security/manager/ssl/VerifySSLServerCertChild.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/VerifySSLServerCertParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "df632f2f822dabfc0ada41634b22465187ac19f0", "parents": ["2057fd30ca70fd02e7cd4829ed48a3490caa075d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726866455, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "178": {"changesets": [{"author": "Julien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916517 - add /usr/bin/firefox to the firefox-esr deb package  a=diannaS\n\nDebian's firefox-esr package adds its own /usr/bin/firefox and diverts\nit away, so we either need to do the same or clean up the diversion in\nour postinst, otherwise /usr/bin/firefox goes permanently missing when\nupgrading from Debian to Mozilla's firefox-esr package.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222752\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222916", "files": ["browser/installer/linux/app/debian/dirs", "browser/installer/linux/app/debian/firefox.sh", "browser/installer/linux/app/debian/postrm.in", "browser/installer/linux/app/debian/preinst.in", "browser/installer/linux/app/debian/rules"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "222b0b232871306e9bc7bf9a61bd29e76a2567de", "parents": ["df632f2f822dabfc0ada41634b22465187ac19f0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726869177, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "179": {"changesets": [{"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1912471 - Disallow deserializing structured clone buffers with transferables more than once r=iain, a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D220644", "files": ["js/public/StructuredClone.h", "js/public/friend/ErrorNumbers.msg", "js/src/jit-test/tests/structured-clone/transferable-cleanup.js", "js/src/vm/StructuredClone.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a0a3a240084e07e666911dc5a516145d1dc8702b", "parents": ["222b0b232871306e9bc7bf9a61bd29e76a2567de"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726871246, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "180": {"changesets": [{"author": "David Parks \u003cdavidp99@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918907: Don't clear drag session target BrowserChild on eDragLeave/eDragExit  a=diannaS\n\nThe BrowserChild should only be cleared on EndDragSession, which is sent when\nthe user finishes or cancels dragging. This is reciprocal to it being set in\nStartDragSession.\n\nThe change to nsDragSessionProxy::EndDragSessionImpl is non-functional -- it\nhighlights the BrowserChild symmetry above.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222389\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222947", "files": ["dom/ipc/BrowserChild.cpp", "widget/nsDragServiceProxy.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d3fc5b03abb8d087f555fe75073651b1fdf8c1d5", "parents": ["a0a3a240084e07e666911dc5a516145d1dc8702b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726875451, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "181": {"changesets": [{"author": "Paul Zuehlcke \u003cpbz@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1916659,  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222629\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222934", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/tabPrompts/browser_confirmFolderUpload.js", "browser/components/prompts/PromptCollection.sys.mjs", "dom/filesystem/tests/script_promptHandler.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d58c0ed99efdaf01a19988a9e437b3916e3527f0", "parents": ["d3fc5b03abb8d087f555fe75073651b1fdf8c1d5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726877470, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "182": {"changesets": [{"author": "Calixte \u003ccdenizet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918301 - Don't display pdfs in pdf.js coming from a multipart response r=valentin, a=dsmith\n\n\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222122\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222966", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/content/PdfStreamConverter.sys.mjs"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c6caa1091788b12c91bb7e2123d2a9bd72b7a192", "parents": ["d58c0ed99efdaf01a19988a9e437b3916e3527f0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Calixte \u003ccdenizet@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1918874 - Don't display json in the json viewer coming from a multipart response. r=#devtools-reviewers, a=dsmith\n\n\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222616\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222970", "files": ["devtools/client/jsonview/converter-child.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "69d7b2277422dd360971d982c62ba9709f53a5c3", "parents": ["c6caa1091788b12c91bb7e2123d2a9bd72b7a192"], "tags": []}], "date": 1726881571, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "183": {"changesets": [{"author": "Steve Fink \u003csfink@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1917554 - Error check transfer map header value r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem, a=dsmith\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D222060", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/structured-clone/transferable-cleanup.js", "js/src/vm/StructuredClone.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d37c693ebd07e191c31ac14c392337a9782cd501", "parents": ["69d7b2277422dd360971d982c62ba9709f53a5c3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1727036133, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "184": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr128 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings -  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.m